        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M1",
            "speaker_id": 77076,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, I've uploaded two high-level layout options for the clinic expansion to kick off T1. Please review. Option A is more compact, while Option B provides a larger staff area. I'm particularly interested in feedback on constructability and how each option tracks against our preliminary budget for T3. The healthcare manager will also be reviewing these this week.",
