        "thread_id": "TH2",
        "thread_goal": "Define and validate the phased construction and access plan.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M19",
            "speaker_id": 77076,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi all, I've drafted the phased construction plan for T4, following the Phased Construction and Access Planning Guide (A4). It proposes a 3-phase sequence to keep the clinic operational. Please review the attached drawings, especially the proposed contractor access routes and material storage areas for T8.",
            "mentions": [
              238683,
              90395,
              145901,
              279207,
              380695
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4",
              "T4",
              "T8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M20",
            "speaker_id": 145901,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "The 3-phase approach looks logical. My only question is on the duration for Phase 2, which involves the main structural work. Is the timeline realistic given the hospital's noise restrictions?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M21",
            "speaker_id": 380695,
            "reply_to": "M20",
            "text": "We can mitigate that by scheduling the loudest activities, like concrete breaking, during the limited weekend shutdown windows mentioned in the plan. We'll have to be very efficient with that time.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M22",
            "speaker_id": 90395,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "I can't see where the material laydown area is on the plan.",
