            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M23",
            "speaker_id": 238683,
            "reply_to": "M22",
            "text": "@90395 It's marked on sheet C-102, in the north-east corner. On that note, I see the proposed contractor access route crosses the main ambulance drop-off zone. We need to confirm with the infection control officer if that's permissible, even with hoardings. It could be a major issue.",
            "mentions": [
              90395
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
