            "speaker_id": 77076,
            "reply_to": "M27",
            "text": "Update: I've spoken with the facility manager. As predicted, crossing the ambulance path is a non-starter. We have been directed to create a new, dedicated contractor access point from the north side of the site. This is now the confirmed route.",
